# Home Base UI

- Primary viewport is still iPhone Safari over VPN; also keep desktop readable (wider max widths, clear contrast).
- Bottom tabs (mobile order): Apps · Work · Chat · Shell · Files · View · Logs · More.
- Work = Apps/Shell/Files scene switcher + bottom-right ChatPanel dock (present shell/files from chat).
- Chat tab = full-page ChatPanel; can present into Work (+ Shell / Apps / Files).
- View = live laptop screen + pointer/keyboard (`/ws/view`); mark stage `data-hb-no-ptr` so pull-to-refresh does not steal gestures.
- Alerts = bell in the thin top status bar; inbox slides top→bottom as a near-full modal; History is a right-side drawer.
- Chat composer supports English speech→text (Web Speech API mic). Cursor done → toast + ping + optional browser Notification.
- Share / password + VPN/homebased restart live under **More/Settings** (localhost for share).
- Shell = interactive PTY + session attach. Logs = capped console ring (300).
- App pickers and Run/Ship use native `<select>` + compact action button (`hb-select`).
- Ship: dropdown + hold-to-confirm Ship (same pattern as Run/Start).
- Pull-to-refresh is global (top-of-scroll drag): part-way soft-refreshes data; deeper pull → `window.location.reload()`.
- Theme: night black+blue / day white+blue via `data-theme`; Syne + IBM Plex Mono. Avoid purple/cream clichés.
- New/Add actions use compact `IconBtn` (`+`), not text labels.
- Layout tokens: `.hb-page`, `.hb-chrome`, `.hb-surface`, floating `.hb-nav` dock with icons + labels; safe-area padding for iPhone.
- Breakpoints: phone-first; iPad (`md`) wider chrome; desktop (`lg`) two-column Apps where useful.
- Shell tab must remain usable with on-screen Ctrl/Esc helpers.
- Cursor tab streams markdown; show project cwd and agent id.
